    "%lld%% to graduation" : {
      "comment" : "A launch's progress, in percent, to graduation (when its coin moves to Soroswap with its liquidity locked).",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld%% para graduarse"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld%% vers la graduation"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "졸업까지 %lld%%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毕业进度 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1,000,000,000 coins. Everyone buys on the same curve; at its target it moves to Soroswap with its liquidity locked forever. You also earn half of the 1% trading fee." : {
      "comment" : "Under the form for launching a coin on Stellar. Soroswap is an exchange's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1.000.000.000 monedas. Todos compran en la misma curva; al llegar a su objetivo pasa a Soroswap con su liquidez bloqueada para siempre. Además ganas la mitad de la comisión de trading del 1%."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 000 000 000 jetons. Tout le monde achète sur la même courbe ; à son objectif, il passe sur Soroswap avec sa liquidité verrouillée pour toujours. Vous touchez aussi la moitié des frais de trading de 1%."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "코인 1,000,000,000개. 모두가 같은 곡선에서 매수하며, 목표에 도달하면 유동성이 영구히 잠긴 채 Soroswap으로 이동해요. 1% 거래 수수료의 절반도 받아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "共 1,000,000,000 枚代币。所有人都在同一条曲线上买入；达到目标后，它会迁移到 Soroswap，流动性永久锁定。你还能获得 1% 交易手续费的一半。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "95% goes to the creator. Your edition carries a 5% creator royalty for future sales." : {
      "comment" : "On a Moment's page, before collecting it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El 95% va al creador. Tu edición lleva un 5% de regalías para el creador en futuras ventas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "95% vont au créateur. Votre édition porte une redevance de 5% pour le créateur sur les ventes futures."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "95%는 크리에이터에게 가요. 내 에디션에는 향후 판매 시 5%의 크리에이터 로열티가 붙어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "95% 归创作者。你的版本在今后转售时附带 5% 的创作者版税。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A video needs its cover frame." : {
      "comment" : "An error when publishing a video Moment: its first frame, which becomes the NFT's image, couldn't be read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un vídeo necesita su fotograma de portada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une vidéo a besoin de son image de couverture."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "동영상에는 표지 프레임이 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "视频需要封面帧。"
          }
        }
