            "value" : "未签名：你确认后，%@ 的网络费用上涨了。未发送任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not signed: the network fee is unusually high right now (%@ XLM). Nothing was sent. Try again in a minute." : {
      "comment" : "An error: the network fee is above the app's limit; %@ is the fee in XLM.",
