            "value" : "你需要重新登录才能使用 Stellar。你的 Stellar 资金仍在你的账户中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've bridged in many times today. Try again tomorrow." : {
      "comment" : "An error: the daily limit of bridge transfers into Stellar was reached.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hoy ya has traído fondos por el puente muchas veces. Vuelve a intentarlo mañana."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous avez utilisé le pont entrant de nombreuses fois aujourd'hui. Réessayez demain."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오늘 브리지로 너무 많이 들여왔습니다. 내일 다시 시도하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你今天已多次跨链转入。明天再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've uploaded a lot today. Try again tomorrow." : {
      "comment" : "An error: the daily upload limit was reached.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hoy has subido mucho. Vuelve a intentarlo mañana."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous avez beaucoup téléversé aujourd'hui. Réessayez demain."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오늘 업로드를 많이 했습니다. 내일 다시 시도하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你今天上传了很多内容。明天再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Monad wallet sends the USDC. It arrives on Stellar in about a minute." : {
      "comment" : "The bridge from Monad to Stellar. Monad and Stellar are network names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu billetera de Monad envía los USDC. Llegan a Stellar en un minuto aproximadamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre portefeuille Monad envoie les USDC. Ils arrivent sur Stellar en une minute environ."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monad 지갑이 USDC를 보내요. 약 1분 뒤 Stellar에 도착해요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由你的 Monad 钱包发送 USDC，约一分钟后到达 Stellar。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Stellar account isn't ready yet. Try again in a moment." : {
      "comment" : "An error at the end of the Stellar account's setup: its transaction was sent, but the account doesn't read as set up yet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu cuenta de Stellar aún no está lista. Vuelve a intentarlo en un momento."
          }
